  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida&apos;s support to OCHA for humanitarian field coordination during     2010-2013 (335 MSEK: 70 MSEK for 2010, 80 MSEK for 2011, and twice 90 MSEK for following years). support in 2010 will reinforce 17 country  offices and includes 14 MSEK in un-allocated funding that OCHA may    use in consultation with Sida for under-funded offices. Annual        dialogue will determine distribution of funding in 2011, 2012 and -13</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sidas st&#xf6;d till OCHA 2010 - 2013 innefattar 335 MSEK,70 MSEK f&#xf6;r      2010, 80 MSEK f&#xf6;r 2011, och 90 MSEK f&#xf6;r 2012 och 2013. St&#xf6;det g&#xe5;r     till ca 17 landkontor som arbetar med att koordinera den humanit&#xe4;ra   responsen i dessa l&#xe4;nder. Koordinering inneb&#xe4;r bla koordinering av    behovsanalyser, strategiska responsplaner samt koordinering av        responsen via kluster och interkluster koordinering, samt dialog.</narrative>
  </description>
